<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Hello,</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />I hope you are doing well! Thank you for your interest in Flywire’s new <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.foleon.com/report/passport-to-higher-education-a-global-payments-study/cover/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;mkt_tok=MzcyLVFTUS02NDkAAAF-iIUg-OLMCkkhLVgjhfR-MIkQOjc_7fRAnxq-YXtCnxExm3x4UvgchM4ItmgRCFIvwdF7mysQ-pcGOLsEtH9hps8_an8ViJ5jIadogMHFYw"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Passport to Higher Education report</u></strong></span></a>. I wanted to reach out and introduce myself. I’m Sharon Butler, EVP Global Education, and would love to learn more about your insights related to this research.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />Flywire is a global payments enablement and software company that helps millions worldwide securely deliver some of life’s most important payments like tuition and other education expenses. In fact, our Comprehensive Receivables Solution and global payment network is trusted by thousands of educational institutions all around the world to make the payment process easier. Check out what the <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/unc?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>University of Northern Colorado</u></strong></span></a>, <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/case-study-usf?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>University of South Florida</u></strong></span></a> and <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/case-study-utk?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>University of Tennessee Knoxville </u></strong></span></a>have to say.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">If you have questions or want to connect, please feel free to drop me an <a style="color: #223341;" href="mailto:teamsharon@flywire.com"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>email</u></strong></span></a> or reach out on <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sharon-butler-flywire/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Linkedin</u></strong></span></a>.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />I look forward to getting to know you.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Best Regards,</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Sharon</p> </td> 
</tr> 
